#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:816
#: fd02fb350d854684913db2c86285642a
msgid ""
"The `palloc` method allows you to get a port. When using this function, "
"you don't need to worry about the port allocation mode, because an "
"allocation mode detector is already implemented in this method."
